/// 🐛️ W4 fix (`.🧬semio/🦑️repo/🎫️tickets/26/07/11/WGPU-RENDERER-FULL-PARITY/report-w4-scene-input.md`): a right-click
/// used to be a total no-op here (this test used to assert the caret/anchor stayed put) — now it
